## Usage & Verification

1. **Initialize and Deploy**:
   ```bash
   terraform init
   terraform plan
   terraform apply -auto-approve
   ```

2. **Send Test Records**:
   ```bash
   aws firehose put-record-batch \
     --delivery-stream-name xfusion-firehose-stream \
     --records '[{"Data":"{\"event\":\"login\",\"user\":\"alice\"}"},{"Data":"{\"event\":\"logout\",\"user\":\"bob\"}"}]'
   ```

3. **Verify S3 Delivery**:
   ```bash
   aws s3 ls s3://xfusion-stream-bucket-150002905 --recursive
   ```

4. **Confirm Clean State**:
   ```bash
   terraform plan
   ```
